I am using UML 2.4.21 on Host 2.4.25 with SKAS supported and the root
file system is busybox-1.2.1
I want to use modules in my UML.
First I tried one module as simple as the example 2-1: hello-1.c at
http://tldp.org/LDP/lkmpg/2.4/html/x149.html and it worked very well.
Then I tried the example 4-1 chardev.c at
http://tldp.org/LDP/lkmpg/2.4/html/x579.html, but I got "unresolved
symbol to_virt" from insmod. I noted it's the calling for put_user()
by chardev.c that lead to use of to_virt(). However, this symbol has
already been exported in System.map of UML.
Could anybody give some suggestion? Thanks a lot!


